data/*.csv
# No exceptions anymore — the fragrance catalog now ships as data/Notes-Extraction-Separated-hybird.xlsx
# (imported once, offline, by scripts/import-hybrid-catalog.cjs into FragranceProduct/
# ExistingCombination) instead of a CSV read live off disk on every request. Every *.csv under
# data/ is now a one-time seed input only ever read locally by scripts/seed-notes.cjs, same as
# order_history.csv/notes.csv already were.